@startuml
!pragma layout smetana

title External machine: the confirmation workflow

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #E3F0DC
    BorderColor #4C7A44
    FontColor #1A1A1E
    AttributeFontColor #3A3A3E
    ArrowColor #4C7A44
    ArrowFontColor #1A1A1E
    StartColor #4C7A44
    EndColor #4C7A44
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FBF3D3
    BorderColor #C9A227
    FontColor #1A1A1E
}
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1A1A1E

state "unconfirmed" as Unconfirmed
state "queried" as Queried
state "affirmed" as Affirmed
state "confirmed" as Confirmed
state "cancelled" as Cancelled #E8D9F0 ##[bold]7A4B93
state "expired" as Expired #E8D9F0 ##[bold]7A4B93

Unconfirmed : Terms not yet agreed
Queried : The two records differ
Affirmed : Both sides agree the terms
Confirmed : Binding written record
Cancelled : Nothing left to agree
Expired : The contract has ceased

[*] --> Unconfirmed : Book
Unconfirmed --> Affirmed : Affirm
Unconfirmed --> Queried : Query
Queried --> Affirmed : Resolve
Affirmed --> Confirmed : Confirm
Confirmed --> Unconfirmed : Amend
Unconfirmed --> Cancelled : Cancel
Queried --> Cancelled : Cancel
Affirmed --> Cancelled : Cancel
Confirmed --> Cancelled : Cancel
Unconfirmed --> Expired : Expire / Mature / Exercise
Queried --> Expired : Expire / Mature / Exercise
Affirmed --> Expired : Expire / Mature / Exercise
Confirmed --> Expired : Expire / Mature / Exercise
Cancelled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]

note right of Confirmed
  Confirmed as of an external version.
  A confirmable amendment moves that
  version and returns the trade to
  unconfirmed.
end note

note left of Unconfirmed
  An unconfirmed trade is a
  counterparty risk: the terms are
  not enforceable in the form the
  parties agreed.
end note

note right of Cancelled
  Shared states, marked in both figures.
  Cancel and Expire are broadcast to both
  machines and terminate each.
end note

@enduml
